  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-scholar-suite",
      "text": "SkillHub 学术工具链 8 技能的 DeepSeek Harness 捆绑套件——一次安装，DeepSeek Harness 里直接用上我们在 SkillHub 上架的全部免费学术技能。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:docsor1212/dsh-scholar-suite\n```\n\n无头模式把 `--profile web` 换成 `--profile headless`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "捆绑技能(8 个)",
      "text": "| 技能 | 版本 | 作用 | SkillHub |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| academic-figures | 5.6.1 | 学术图表:GLM 黄蓝双斜线风格,按真数据设计,VL 审核 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/academic-figures) |\n| humanize-ai-text | 4.2.0 | 去 AI 味改写:文本层特征清洗,保留原意与密度 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/humanize-ai-text) |\n| paper-polisher | 6.2.0 | 论文润色:语域/混写预警/对照可视化双栏报告 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/paper-polisher-pro) |\n| pubmed-verifier | 5.4.0 | PubMed 引文核验:DOI/PMID 逐条对账 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/pubmed-verifier) |\n| doc-holmes | 3.0.1 | 著作医生:中文医学著作引用形态核验 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/doc-holmes) |\n| paper-rewriter | 4.2.0 | 论文改写:结构与表述重塑 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/paper-rewriter) |\n| cite-holmes | 4.6.0 | 引文核验:中文著录完整版,[EB/OL] 类 URL 自动取证 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/cite-holmes) |\n| cn-med-oa | 2.4.1 | 中文医学公众号:文章结构与发布流程 | [链接](https://skillhub.cn/skills/cn-med-oa) |"
    },
    {
      "section": "捆绑技能(8 个)",
      "text": "版本 = SkillHub 上架最新版(构建时逐技能对账,见 `skills/manifest.json`)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用法",
      "text": "- **直接说需求**:技能已整包注册,模型按描述自动路由——\"帮我把这段改得不像 AI 写的\"\"核验这篇论文的引文\";\n- **斜杠命令**:每技能一条方法卡,如 `/cite-holmes 这篇的引文帮我过一遍`、`/paper-polisher-pro`;`/suite-status` 看全部技能与版本。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全声明(供安装前审查)",
      "text": "- **插件本体**:零联网、零遥测、无安装期脚本(package.json 无 lifecycle scripts)、不读凭据;\n- **捆绑技能的联网行为(如实声明)**:\n  - 纯本地运行:academic-figures、humanize-ai-text、paper-rewriter;\n  - 按功能会访问外部服务:pubmed-verifier / cite-holmes / doc-holmes(NCBI E-utilities、期刊与 DOI 解析服务)、paper-polisher(对照报告生成,可选外部排版服务)、cn-med-oa(公众号平台接口)——是否联网由对应技能的功能触发,细则见各自 SKILL.md;\n- **写盘范围**:仅当前工作目录(报告/核验产物);\n- **子进程**:技能脚本按各自文档调用本机 Python 3.8+(标准库优先,个别可选依赖见技能文档)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "更新",
      "text": "技能更新后,本套件随版本发布重新打包(构建时逐技能与 SkillHub latestVersion 对账,不一致即构建失败)。重装即更新:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:docsor1212/dsh-scholar-suite\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "上游",
      "text": "- 各技能的独立上架页见上表(SkillHub);aesthete-agent(前端美学)另有独立插件 [dsh-aesthete-agent](https://github.com/docsor1212/dsh-aesthete-agent)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT(各捆绑技能许可见其目录内声明)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-scholar-suite",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness native plugin bundling the 8 free academic skills we publish on SkillHub — one install, the whole toolkit."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:docsor1212/dsh-scholar-suite\n```\n\nUse `--profile headless` for headless mode."
    },
    {
      "section": "Bundled skills (8)",
      "text": "| Skill | Version | What it does |\n|---|---|---|\n| academic-figures | 5.6.1 | Academic figures, mechanically validated, designed from real data |\n| humanize-ai-text | 4.2.0 | Strip AI-flavor from text while preserving meaning |\n| paper-polisher | 6.2.0 | Paper polishing with side-by-side diff reports |\n| pubmed-verifier | 5.4.0 | PubMed citation verification (DOI/PMID) |\n| doc-holmes | 3.0.1 | Chinese medical book-citation verification |\n| paper-rewriter | 4.2.0 | Paper rewriting (structure & expression) |\n| cite-holmes | 4.6.0 | Reference verification incl. [EB/OL] URL evidence |\n| cn-med-oa | 2.4.1 | Chinese medical WeChat-official-account writing |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Bundled skills (8)",
      "text": "Versions track the latest published on SkillHub (reconciled at build time, see `skills/manifest.json`)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "- **Just ask**: skills are registered wholesale — \"make this paragraph sound human\", \"verify the citations in this paper\";\n- **Slash commands**: each skill has a method card (`/cite-holmes`, `/paper-polisher`, …); `/suite-status` lists all."
    },
    {
      "section": "Security declaration (for pre-install review)",
      "text": "- **Plugin itself**: zero telemetry, no lifecycle scripts, no credential access;\n- **Bundled skills' network behavior**: academic-figures / humanize-ai-text / paper-rewriter run fully local; pubmed-verifier / cite-holmes / doc-holmes may query NCBI E-utilities and DOI resolution services; paper-polisher may use optional external layout services; cn-med-oa talks to the WeChat official-account platform — all triggered only by the corresponding skill's function, details in each SKILL.md;\n- **Disk writes**: current working directory only (reports / verification artifacts)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Update",
      "text": "Rebuilt and re-released whenever member skills update (build fails unless each member matches its SkillHub latestVersion). Reinstall to update."
    },
    {
      "section": "Upstream",
      "text": "Independent SkillHub listings linked above; the frontend-aesthetics engine ships separately as [dsh-aesthete-agent](https://github.com/docsor1212/dsh-aesthete-agent)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
